    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Hold every model equation and parameter fixed, apply only the specified time-varying stimuli, and test whether post-training responses satisfy associative-memory criteria. Any hidden parameter or structural update, or failure of the response, would refute the claim.";
